Summon Elemental Dies
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to SummonElemental_NazgrekUnit
                (Triggering unit) Equal to SummonElemental_ZulkisUnit
    Actions
        -------- Remove Dead Elemental from Group --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                ((Triggering unit) is in ElementalGroupNazgrek.) Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                Unit Group - Remove (Triggering unit) from ElementalGroupNazgrek.
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                ((Triggering unit) is in ElementalGroupZulkis.) Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                Unit Group - Remove (Triggering unit) from ElementalGroupZulkis.
            Else - Actions
        -------- Disable Follow Trigger if No Elementals Exist --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in ElementalGroupNazgrek) Equal to 0
                (Number of units in ElementalGroupZulkis) Equal to 0
            Then - Actions
                Trigger - Turn off Summon Elemental Follow <gen>
            Else - Actions
